## Generated Dart files
# Sportity fork: tracked-in-VCS so the package is consumable as a `git:`
# pub dependency. Upstream excludes these because pub.dev's publish step
# bundles build_runner output into the archive; that path isn't taken
# for git deps. Re-run `dart run build_runner build` in `forui/` after
# pulling/rebasing to refresh.
# **.control.dart
# **.design.dart
